@startuml
title SD-F06 — Event settlement and equipment closure
caption To-Be draft | PRD-15–17 / SA-F06 · Event / Settlement
actor Customer as C
actor Merchant as M
boundary API
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant Worker
C -> API : Provide proof against exact quote charge
API -> DB : TX-05 attach proof and enter review
M -> API : Verify deposit or balance independently
API -> DB : TX-06 post receipt and record effective deadline or reschedule/refund case [DEC-021]
opt Verified deposit or balance shortfall [DEC-028]
 alt Existing cutoff still ahead
  M -> API : Request exact outstanding amount
  API -> DB : Queue notice using existing cutoff and mismatch case
  C -> API : Register timely supplement evidence
  M -> API : Verify new movement independently
  API -> DB : Settle only exact eligible net total once
 else Shortfall unresolved after cutoff
  API -> DB : Keep actual receipts in manual reconciliation
 end
end
Worker -> DB : TX-08 apply expiry or balance reminder only if eligible
alt DEC-021 infeasible after verified deposit
 M -> API : Record consented reschedule or reconcile refund
 alt Settled balance or future new-date due plus 24 h grace
  API -> DB : Swap unused window and revise deadline if unpaid [DEC-027]
 else Outstanding due no longer feasible
  API -> DB : Keep original commitments and open case for another date or refund
 end
else Overdue beyond effective cutoff
 alt Timely balance proof still in review
  API -> DB : Preserve slot and block nonpayment cancellation
 else No funds found after review and bank check
  M -> API : Attest no balance funds and record cancellation reason
  API -> DB : Recheck current cutoff, proof and ledger, then release unused slot
 else Paid or disputed funds
  M -> API : Verify balance or reconcile without nonpayment cancellation
 end
else Booking proceeds
 M -> API : Reopen recorded equipment-out and prior check
 M -> API : Record setup, teardown and equipment checks
 M -> API : Issue itemized extra charge if needed
 API -> DB : TX-07 record check and independent obligation
end
opt Customer requests cancellation after payment
 C -> API : Attempt cancellation
 API -> DB : Recheck known payment facts under lock
 API --> C : Decline without state or refund change
end
note over DB,Worker : Timely deposit proof keeps the window during merchant review [DEC-020]
@enduml
